<title>UK: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP WINNERS' CUP FIRST ROUND FIRST LEG RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP WINNERS' CUP FIRST ROUND FIRST LEG RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of European Cup Winners' Cup first round, first leg matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>In Eschen, Liechtenstein: </p>
<p>FC Vaduz (Liechtenstein) 0 Paris Saint-Germain (France) 4 (halftime 0-3)</p>
<p>Scorers: Paul Le Guen (12th minute), Julio Cesar Dely Valdes (40th), Leonardo (44th), Bernard Allou (73rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,900</p>
<p>In Moscow: Lokomotiv Moscow (Russia) 1 Varteks Varadzin (Croatia) 0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Igor Cherevchenko (12th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
<p>In Batumi: Dynamo Batumi (Georgia) 1 PSV Eindhoven (Netherlands) 1 (1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Dynamo - Amiran Mudjiri (21st)</p>
<p>PSV - Luc Nilis (penalty, 39th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>In Anjalankoski, Finland:</p>
<p>MyPa-47 (Finland) 0 Liverpool (England) 1 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Stig-Inge Bjornebye (61st)</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,500  </p>
<p>In Aarhus: Aarhus (Denmark) 1 Olimpija Ljubljana (Slovenia)</p>
<p>1 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Aarhus - Lennart Bak (15th)</p>
<p>Olimpija - Kliton Bozgo (57th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,900</p>
</text>
